#ASSERT (`pos` `pv` FALSE (Date 2 3 2005) (Date 1 3 2023) TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 0 0 0 (Date 1 1 2024))'s `I am eligible under s 4A` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT (`pos` `pv` FALSE (Date 2 3 2005) (Date 1 3 2023) TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 0 0 0 (Date 1 1 2024))'s `the Minister must provide me tuition` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT (`pos` `pv` FALSE (Date 2 3 2005) (Date 1 3 2023) TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 0 0 0 (Date 1 1 2024))'s `the last day to register` EQUALS JUST (Date 29 2 2024)
