#ASSERT (`pos` `pv` FALSE (Date 1 1 1990) (Date 1 3 2023) FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST (Date 1 4 2023)) (JUST (Date 1 5 2023)) 0 0 0 (Date 1 1 2024))'s `the Minister must provide me tuition` EQUALS FALSE
